question_text:
(a) whether Government has assessed the impact of heatwaves, erratic monsoon, flash floods, cyclones and cloudbursts on agriculture, public health, infrastructure and the economy during the last three years;
(b) the State-wise details of casualties, economic losses and damage caused by such extreme weather events, along with forecast accuracy and effectiveness of early warning systems;
(c) whether Government proposes to modernize IMD through nationwide Doppler weather radar coverage, AI-driven forecasting and district-level weather warnings; and
(d) the details of the national strategy, timeline and financial outlay for Himalayan glacial lake monitoring, earthquake and tsunami preparedness, the Deep Ocean Mission and coastal resilience?

